<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3848"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Q<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Q<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 09, 2005 - 7:28 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->So who answered the door?... <BR> <BR>Yeah... I want to leave my kid at PJs ABC 401s... not! <BR> <BR>Spooky how the light hit&#39;s the house next door and only the gate at 401. <BR> <BR>BTW: I&#39;m in Michigan so I won&#39;t be auditioning. <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
