<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5660"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Whoisbtk<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Whoisbtk<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, February 01, 2005 - 5:39 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->A Kechi man was indicted for possession of child pornography showing sadistic/masochistic acts. <a href="http://www.arkvalleynews.com/web/isite.dll?1101243618968" target=_top>http://www.arkvalleynews.com/web/isite.dll?1101243 618968</a> <BR> <BR>Police Chief Morland revealed that Kechi P.D. has a machine gun and would use it if necessary. <a href="http://www.arkvalleynews.com/web/isite.dll?1101243114828" target=_top>http://www.arkvalleynews.com/web/isite.dll?1101243 114828</a> <BR>It probably came with the Corvette. <BR> <BR>For a town of 2000, Kechi has some strange folks. <BR> <BR><a href="mailto:whoisbtk@yahoo.com">whoisbtk@yahoo.com</a> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
